<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" Content-type="text/css" href="/system/resource/style/component/news/content/format2.css"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div class="nr">
	<div class="main_bd">
	         <div class="con_title">
   <h2 class="title">我校男子排球队在陕西省第十八届运动会中取得优异成绩</h2>
   <p class="info">来源：<span class="xxly">
    </span>时间：<span class="time1">2026-08-10</span>点击数：<i class="djs"><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1641759486, 7472)</script></i></p>
                 </div>



    <div id="vsb_content_2" class="content"><div class="v_news_content">
<p class="vsbcontent_start" style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">（通讯员：张文翰 易宗阳）8月3日，备受瞩目的陕西省第十八届运动会“中国大唐杯”大学生男子排球比赛在白水县全民健身中心体育馆正式拉开帷幕。经过多日激烈角逐，西安电子科技大学男子排球队在领队高鹏飞老师，教练张文翰老师，助理教练吴杰老师的带领下，最终荣获甲组第四，乙组第三的好成绩。备赛期间，教练员和运动员坚持一日两练，为创造优异成绩辛勤准备。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/C/7B/BA/D321531554912541ED04EF57257_54A9E470_16553.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/C7BBAD321531554912541ED04EF57257/54A9E470/16553" vheight=" 281px" vwidth=" 500px" width="500" height="281" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" orisrc="/__local/9/9C/91/AEC19BBC3122B1C747963F4F598_42F720CA_12A17.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 500px; height: 281px;"></p><p style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">本次赛事由陕西省人民政府主办，根据赛事规程，仅允许在去年陕西省大学生排球联赛中获得前八名的队伍参赛，基本代表了陕西省大学生排球运动的最高水平。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/3/F0/33/43D77B571092AFECDD536E455F7_92260619_14CE7.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/3F03343D77B571092AFECDD536E455F7/92260619/14CE7" vheight=" 281px" vwidth=" 500px" width="500" height="281" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" orisrc="/__local/0/0E/55/7C3BAE1AF8A64A16A9277D8C0A2_0DA5D77D_13AF8.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 500px; height: 281px;"></p><p style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">赛场上，西电男排队员们始终保持高昂的斗志。无论是甲组还是乙组，面对省内高校强劲对手，队员们在网前争夺中敢打敢拼，在防守反击中每球必争，充分的体现了顽强拼搏、永不言弃的体育精神。</span></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/4/E0/0F/5F8C0031BDF52B182CC0BD48922_38622C97_169D8.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/4E00F5F8C0031BDF52B182CC0BD48922/38622C97/169D8" vheight=" 210px" vwidth=" 500px" width="500" height="210" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" orisrc="/__local/9/C1/9F/85E03F01701CFC25BD391B77109_A234E2C7_12F08.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 500px; height: 210px;"></p><p class="vsbcontent_img" style="font-size: 20px;"><img src="/__local/9/BD/64/0A3F9E8E544E1E89390380E17D4_F4F2DF4D_14B11.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/9BD640A3F9E8E544E1E89390380E17D4/F4F2DF4D/14B11" vheight=" 281px" vwidth=" 500px" width="500" height="281" border="0" vspace="0" hspace="0" title="" alt="" orisrc="/__local/D/8E/2A/94234DF353BFE7FF9EB04D96744_CD2CAB1F_F49F.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="width: 500px; height: 281px;"></p><p class="vsbcontent_end" style="font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">此次在省运会中双双跻身前列，不仅是对队员们日常刻苦训练的最好回报，更是学校体育教育成果的生动体现。通过参与此类省级高水平赛事，队员们的竞技水平、抗压能力和团队协作意识得到了磨练和提升。赛后，队员们纷纷表示，将以此为契机，认真总结经验、改进不足，在今后的训练中继续发扬永不言败的体育精神，力争在未来比赛中再创佳绩，为西电体育事业的高质量发展贡献青春力量。</span></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
    
<div class="page">
  <p><span>上一条：</span><a href="7502.htm">省运双冠！西电男篮斩获陕西省第十八届运动会大学生组男子篮球（甲组、乙组）冠军</a></p>
  <p><span>下一条：</span><a href="7482.htm">驰骋全国赛场，砺技逐光而行：西电跆拳道队全国总决赛获佳绩</a></p>
</div>


</div></div>
</form>
